                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3499149a-57e8-3e11-8c8d-b337ae8a4ca5",
                        "entry_id": "6db62166-3e79-3582-9100-0d5d86583d32",
                        "glosses": [
                            "theurgist, theurge"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2557ea1f-57a5-4f1e-bb06-0e0d85323fad",
                                "sense_id": "3499149a-57e8-3e11-8c8d-b337ae8a4ca5",
                                "text": "В городах Малой Азии ― Никомидии, Пергаме, Смирне ― девятнадцатилетний Юлиан, искавший эллинской мудрости, слышал о знаменитом теу́рге и софисте, Ямвлике из Халкиды, ученике Порфирия неоплатоника, о божественном Ямвлике, как все его называли.",
                                "translation": "In the cities of Asia Minor―Nicomedia, Pergamon, Smyrna―the nineteen-year-old Julian, searching for Hellenic wisdom, heard of Iamblichus of Chalcis, the famous theurgist and sophist, a student of Porphyry the Neoplatonist; the divine Iamblichus, as everyone called him.",
                                "english": "In the cities of Asia Minor―Nicomedia, Pergamon, Smyrna―the nineteen-year-old Julian, searching for Hellenic wisdom, heard of Iamblichus of Chalcis, the famous theurgist and sophist, a student of Porphyry the Neoplatonist; the divine Iamblichus, as everyone called him."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
